WEBVTT

33:32.287 --> 33:33.997
Daenerys.

33:34.122 --> 33:36.124
There's our bride-to-be.

33:37.125 --> 33:39.711
Look, a gift from Illyrio.

33:41.296 --> 33:42.880
Touch it.

33:43.006 --> 33:45.216
Go on, feel the fabric.

33:50.138 --> 33:51.139
Mmm.

33:53.308 --> 33:55.143
Isn't he a gracious host?

33:58.521 --> 34:02.191
We've been his guests for over a year
and he's never asked us for anything.
